&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI accelerates production but editorial ownership remains human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;7. Measurement System&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;7-measurement-system&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#7-measurement-system&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
